# Replacement effects are unaffected by Hushbringer (the rulings: "Leyline of the Void will still exile creatures that
# would die"). Bot1's Badgermole Cub earthbends its Forest; Bot2 has Hushbringer and Rest in Peace out, and Bolts the
# creature land on turn 4. Rest in Peace exiles it instead of letting it die (CR 614.1a), so it never dies, and its "When
# this land dies or is put into exile, return it to the battlefield tapped" triggers for the exile: the Forest returns.
# Hushbringer's own game where the sacrificed land dies, and does not return, is the contrast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Badgermole Cub
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Hushbringer
Rest in Peace
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

